OL,3,GNEWSAYour photos: Horse close-ups and
OL,4,Asunbathing cats
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe love to feature your photographs
OL,7,Fshowing the beauty of the West Midlands
OL,8,Fin all kinds of ways.
OL,10,FThis week, we have a mixture of scenic
OL,11,Fviews and quirky shots of animals,
OL,12,Fincluding a curious horse and a lazy
OL,13,Fcat.
OL,15,FYou can be part of future galleries
OL,16,Fwith your own photos of the area -
OL,17,Fupload your images via BBC Weather
OL,18,FWatchers or email us at
OL,19,Fmidlandstoday@bbc.co.uk.
